</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
                 <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{tar}}\leftarrow\text{Update}_{R_{\text{tar}}}(\mathbf{W},R_{\text{tar}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{tar}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{sur}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{anc}},\eta,\lambda)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tar</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>Update</mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tar</mtext></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐖</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tar</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>tar</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>sur</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>anc</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{tar}}\leftarrow\text{Update}_{R_{\text{tar}}}(\mathbf{W},R_{\text{tar}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{tar}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{sur}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{anc}},\eta,\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math> by Eq. (<a href="#S3.E11" title="In 3.4 Robust Training for CPE ‣ 3 Concept Pinpoint Eraser via Residual Attention Gate ‣ Concept Pinpoint Eraser for Text-to-image Diffusion Models via Residual Attention Gate" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>) without middle term

</div>
