<figure id="S4.F5" class="ltx_figure">
<p id="S4.F5.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center ltx_align_center"><span id="S4.F5.2.1" class="ltx_text"><img src="2506.22806v1/adv_attack_main_fig_v2.png" id="S4.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/115;" width="548" height="115" alt="Refer to caption"></span></p>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Qualitative results of CPE and baselines on robustness to adversarial attacks by UnlearnDiff <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib73" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al., 2023c</a>)</cite>. It shows that CPE successfully defends against adversarial attack prompts.</figcaption>
</figure>
