<td id="A3.T5.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b" style="padding:0.25pt 2.0pt;">SD v2.1 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib50" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rombach, 2022</a>)</cite></td>
